<p class="size-chart__tip">To measure: lay a similar-fitting tee flat and measure straight across, just below the armpit — that's the "chest laid flat" number above. Body length runs from the highest point of the shoulder to the hem.</p>

<p class="size-chart__source">Source: <a href="https://www.bellacanvas.com/spec/3001.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bella + Canvas official spec sheet</a>. Measurements can vary by up to 1&quot;.</p>
